---
import Arrow from '../../components/mori/Arrow.astro';
import '../../styles/mori.css';
import '../../styles/mori-reading.css';
import '../../styles/mori-home.css';
import '../../styles/mori-bookends.css';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" /><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow" /><title>作品与探索 · B 方案预览</title></head>
<body class="mori-site m-home-site poster-preview">
<nav class="poster-preview-bar" aria-label="预览导航"><span>B 方案 · 项目海报</span><div><a href="/preview/work-studio/">对比 A 版</a><a href="/#selected-work">查看原版 ↗</a></div></nav>
<main class="m-home" id="main"><section class="m-home-work m-scene" id="selected-work" aria-labelledby="home-work-title">
  <header class="m-home-work-heading">
    <h2 class="m-display" id="home-work-title">作品与探索</h2>
    <p class="m-subtitle">实际运营、独立开发和个人实验。</p>
  </header>
  <div class="m-home-work-main" data-project-id="inky-paper">
    <a class="m-desk" href="/projects/inky-paper/" aria-label="查看 Inky Paper 案例"><img class="m-desk-scene" src="/mori/previews/poster-b/inky-paper.svg" alt="Inky Paper 项目封面，展示真实工作台界面" loading="eager" /><span class="m-view-bubble">查看</span></a>
    <div class="m-project-caption"><div><h3>Inky Paper</h3><p>把任务规划、专注执行和复盘放进同一套工作流程。</p></div><div class="m-project-caption-link"><p>独立设计与开发</p><a class="m-link" href="/projects/inky-paper/">查看案例 <Arrow /></a></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="m-home-work-side">
    <article data-project-id="netease-ai-workflow"><a href="/projects/#netease-ai-workflow" aria-label="查看网易项目"><img class="m-studio-console" src="/mori/previews/poster-b/player-path.svg" alt="三组玩家卡片沿朱红路径连接到审核消息的概念海报" /></a><h3>网易</h3><h4>游戏用户分层与 AI 辅助触达</h4><p>连接用户理解、策略生成、客服执行与效果反馈。</p></article>
    <article data-project-id="seven-angry-man"><a href="/projects/#seven-angry-man" aria-label="探索多智能体陪审团"><img class="m-jury-image" src="/mori/previews/poster-b/evidence-dialogue.svg" alt="同一份证据连接赞同、反对与讨论意见的概念海报" loading="eager" /></a><h3>多智能体陪审团</h3><h4>一次关于讨论的实验</h4><p>观察 AI 如何回应证据、讨论与改变立场。</p><a class="m-link m-jury-link" href="https://seven-angry-agent-f6vjdwtdxgluau6qkvfmxv.streamlit.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">探索原型 <Arrow /></a></article>
  </div>
  <a class="m-link m-all-work" href="/projects/">查看全部作品 <Arrow /></a>
</section>
</main>
</body></html>
<style is:global>
.poster-preview-bar { max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto; padding:16px 0; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:16px; font-size:14px; }
.poster-preview-bar span { color:var(--red); }
.poster-preview .m-home-work { min-height:calc(100svh - 56px); margin-block:0; }
.poster-preview .m-desk { aspect-ratio:3/2; }
.poster-preview .m-desk-scene { width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:contain; }

.poster-preview .m-studio-console,.poster-preview .m-jury-image { display:block; width:100%; height:clamp(100px,calc(22svh - 60px),160px); object-fit:contain; object-position:left center; filter:none; }
@media(max-width:1312px) { .poster-preview-bar { margin-inline:56px; } }
@media(max-width:900px) { .poster-preview-bar { margin-inline:20px; font-size:12px; } .poster-preview .m-home-work { min-height:0; } .poster-preview .m-studio-console,.poster-preview .m-jury-image { height:auto; aspect-ratio:3/1; } }
.poster-preview-bar>div { display:flex; gap:24px; }
.poster-preview .m-home-work-side article>a:first-child { display:block; }
.poster-preview .m-studio-console,.poster-preview .m-jury-image { background:#e9e6de; object-fit:contain; object-position:center; }
.poster-preview .m-desk { background:#e9e6de; }
@media(max-width:600px) { .poster-preview-bar>div { gap:14px; } }
</style>
